# ⭐ THE ROW THE FIRST DISPOSITION GOT WRONG, KEPT HERE BECAUSE OF IT. 120 was
# proposed for permanent EXCLUSION as a "chosen input nothing reproduces". It is
# not: it is a hand-kept MIRROR that announces itself in three places, and
# `tests/integration.rs`'s own comment on the third says a change to MAX_WIDTH
# should red these tests "instead of silently sliding their expectations along
# with it". Exclusion does not make drift impossible — it makes it INVISIBLE.
