# ⚠ scan = none, and this is the honest half of the LAND, DEGRADED disposition:
# 120 is a three-digit value that occurs legitimately all over the tree (column
# numbers, byte counts, sizes). The uniqueness guard cannot police it, so the
# MIRROR check is 100% of this row's enforcement. Saying so is the point — a
# `scan = standard` here would be a waiver farm, which is how a guard dies.
